in 3000 Euros (Lottery A). So the decision reason is applicable: it can be applied to the lotteries using the mean outcome (aspiration level) and comparing the probability of positive differences. The relevant information is derived from the outcomes and probabilities, and the reason is fully defined and applicable.",
